# NOT read by wrangler any more: assets.directory is "./public" (2026-09-13),
# and wrangler reads .assetsignore from inside the assets directory — see
# public/.assetsignore. Kept so that if the directory is ever pointed back at
# the repo root, repo internals and local secrets still stay unpublished.
